      ],
      "text": "amux runs git with repository hooks and core.fsmonitor disabled so a checked-out repo cannot execute code merely because amux touched it; AMUX_ALLOW_GIT_HOOKS=1 re-enables hooks, while git-lfs filters are never disabled."
    },
