        "slc_1d2c7b4bf12ea81e7818d88bcc9e297e625d0dac1ac1eecf4544e17f7708266a"
      ],
      "text": "Commit (key 'c') stages and commits on the workspace's own branch without pushing; merge (key 'M') uses git merge --no-ff in the primary checkout, refusing if the base branch is not checked out there, and lists conflicted files on conflict."
    },
